What is taken from it here (issue #907), unchanged:
- codex-rs/models-manager/models.json, Codex's bundled model catalog, as
  internal/controlplane/modelgateway/codexmodels/models.json;
- codex-rs/models-manager/prompt.md, the instructions Codex gives a model it
  does not know (models-manager/src/model_info.rs BASE_INSTRUCTIONS), as
  internal/controlplane/modelgateway/codexmodels/prompt.md.

The model gateway serves them back to the Codex CLI as its catalog, each entry
renamed to the gateway's model and given the gateway's window and effort levels
(internal/controlplane/modelgateway/codex_catalog.go).
